desc:
Lets you create an SMS campaign.

Make sure the following conditions apply:
- You are using all the mandatory parameters;
- The	recipient source exists in your Suite (in case of batch SMS sending);
- **source_type** and **source_id** must be *null* or undefined in case of AC type requests;
- TWIG template syntax is used.
